      "writtenOn": "2025-06-21T16:34:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In other cases we `ForceSet` the toggle to `false` if the feature is not supported, which means that the user cannot override it and use the feature anyway.\n\nI don\u0027t know if there\u0027s a particular reason to do it one way or the other though. @cwallez@chromium.org ?",
      "revId": "87f2ce38b5c4252ec534ca119c5cad00cb8f8582",
