      "lineNbr": 987,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-23T08:20:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A default can be overriden, ForceSet cannot and we use it when we know that this will break down if the toggle doesn\u0027t have the correct value. So in this case it should `Default(platform-\u003eIsFeatureEnabled)` and `if (!HasExt) {ForceSet(false)}` to honor the Finch, while preventing use when not supported by the driver.",
