        "id": 1002266
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-23T18:39:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I doubt for a while. SPIR-V 1.4 was sort of special because it added new instructions that were not available via an extension previously. 1.4 should be the highest we need to go and then use extensions for the rest. That will only be true until some extension requires a higher version, but cooperative matrix was recently reduced to a 1.3 requirement (from 1.6) so it should not be common to simply require higher versions.",
      "parentUuid": "a9a73236_453e5cf0",
